1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,118
Back a token before it hits pump.fun.

2
00:00:05,268 --> 00:00:11,227
Backers pool SOL before the token
exists, at least 1 SOL. Miss the minimum

3
00:00:11,227 --> 00:00:14,284
and everyone is refunded in full.

4
00:00:15,084 --> 00:00:20,679
At launch, one instruction creates the
token on pump.fun and makes the first buy

5
00:00:20,679 --> 00:00:24,016
with the pool. Nothing can get in between.

6
00:00:24,840 --> 00:00:30,049
That bundle sits in a program vault,
worked by a rate-limited vault

7
00:00:30,049 --> 00:00:35,335
agent. It sells small clips into
strength, buys back dips, and every

8
00:00:35,335 --> 00:00:41,177
trade passes the program's checks:
2% band, 3% impact, hourly budgets.

9
00:00:41,977 --> 00:00:48,726
Creator fees split three ways: 75% to the
vault, 15% buys and burns the Holdfast

10
00:00:48,726 --> 00:00:55,201
token, 10% goes to backers. What the
agent sells for stays in the vault.

11
00:00:56,010 --> 00:01:02,441
When the vault's liquid SOL is 5× what
went in and the chart is strong, backers

12
00:01:02,441 --> 00:01:09,028
are paid back: principal first, then 15%
of the vault, at most once per 4 h.

13
00:01:09,828 --> 00:01:12,324
holdfast.fun

